Express route:
app.get('/api/invoices/:id', requireUser, async (req, res) => {
  const invoice = await invoices.findById(req.params.id);
  if (!invoice) return res.sendStatus(404);
  res.json(invoice);
});

requireUser validates a session and sets req.user.id. Invoice records contain ownerUserId. No downstream authorization middleware is registered for this route.
